      "showCustomOption": true,
      "en": {
        "question": "The adventurers’ choice:",
        "options": [
          "“Of course, Mari. You’re one of us now.”",
          "“Either way is fine. You’re welcome to come if you want, but there’s no pressure.”",
          "“Doesn’t the cathedral still need your help with quite a few things? We’ll come and see you when we get back.”",
